| Area | Changes |
| --- | --- |
| Relic | create, set title, delete, restore, retire, unretire, move to a schema version |
| Properties | set one, clear one |
| Parts | add, set one field, clear one field, set body (with its format and the version it started from), record a merged body, move, remove, restore |
| Links | add, remove |
| History | checkpoint (written by compaction) |

One command may record several of these together. They are stored as one commit and applied together or not at all.
